{"id":"A2-L037","title":"Irregular verbs 3: fall, feel, find, forget, get, give","cefr":"A2","level":"A2","unit":"A2-U03","focus":"Irregulares 3: fall, feel, find, forget, get, give","targets":{"grammar":"Irregulares 3: fall, feel, find, forget, get, give","pron":"Schwa /ə/","verbs":["lend"],"pv":[],"expr":["I can’t make it"],"words":["lift","stabbing","scrape","nap","excuse","kneecap","elbow","ice pack","sore","limp","tumble","crash","first-aid","antiseptic","plaster","bad day"],"field":"Saúde cotidiana","genre":"Blog, diário, crônica","skill":"Leitura","words_min":16},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 37 · Irregular verbs 3: fall, feel, find, forget, get, give","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Irregulares 3: fall, feel, find, forget, get, give.","**Verbos:** lend.","**Expressões:** I can’t make it.","**Pronúncia:** Schwa /ə/.","**10 palavras novas** (saúde cotidiana).","**Texto do dia:** blog, diário, crônica."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A2):** eu consigo usar o passado de fall, feel, find, forget, get e give e dizer I can’t make it."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você começa a praticar tarefas curtas no formato das provas.","Esta aula treina **ler textos curtos e achar informação (IELTS Reading, TOEFL Reading)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["lift","carona"],["stabbing","pontada"],["scrape","arranhão"],["nap","cochilo"],["excuse","desculpa"],["kneecap","kneecap"],["elbow","elbow"],["ice pack","ice pack"],["sore","sore"],["limp","limp"],["tumble","tumble"],["crash","crash"],["first-aid","first-aid"],["antiseptic","antiseptic"],["plaster","plaster"],["bad day","bad day"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A blog post","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"The Day Everything Went Wrong","paras":["I **fell** off my bike, **felt** a sharp pain and **forgot** my phone at home. Someone **found** my keys, and a neighbor **gave** me a ride. I **got** home late and **lent** my friend my umbrella.","Tonight I **can’t make it** to the party: I **got** sick and **gave** up. Lesson: not every day goes well."],"kicker":"BLOG","by":"Mel","gloss":[["sharp","agudo"],["ride","carona"],["give up","desistir"],["sick","doente"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Mel fell off her bike.","ans":"T","why":"fell off."},{"q":"Mel remembered her phone.","ans":"F","why":"forgot."},{"q":"Mel can come to the party.","ans":"F","why":"can’t make it."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“ride” (carona) = ?","opts":["carona","passeio","estrada"],"ans":0,"why":"ride."},{"q":"“sharp” = ?","opts":["agudo","suave","longo"],"ans":0,"why":"sharp."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Irregular verbs 3","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Base","Passado","Particípio"],"rows":[["fall","**fell**","**fallen**"],["feel","**felt**","**felt**"],["find","**found**","**found**"],["forget","**forgot**","**forgotten**"],["get","**got**","**got / gotten**"],["give","**gave**","**given**"]],"cap":"Irregular verbs 3"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Para recusar convites: **I can’t make it.** (Não vou conseguir ir.)"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"I ___ off my bike. (fall)","a":"fell","why":"fall-fell."},{"s":"Someone ___ my keys. (find)","a":"found","why":"find-found."},{"s":"He ___ me a ride. (give)","a":"gave","why":"give-gave."},{"s":"I ___ my phone. (forget)","a":"forgot","why":"forget-forgot."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["lift","carona"],["stabbing","pontada"],["scrape","arranhão"],["helmet","capacete"],["handlebar","guidão"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in orde